PN,37401
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1786726079
OL,3,CLondon now 'educational outlier' ahead
OL,4,Cof other regions ` expert
OL,6,FChildren in England are growing up in
OL,7,F"very different worlds of opportunity"
OL,8,Fdepending on where they live, it has
OL,9,Fbeen suggested, as A-level figures
OL,10,Frevealed stark regional divides in
OL,11,Fresults.
OL,13,FLondon is becoming an "educational
OL,14,Foutlier", pulling ahead of many other
OL,15,Fparts of the country, according to one
OL,16,Fsocial mobility expert, who warned
OL,17,Flatest A-level results indicate the
OL,18,Fcurrent system is "not working" for
OL,19,Fmany youngsters.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@fO]uD@WOUvD@HO]zD@SOUzD@_O]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1786726079
OL,3,CLondon now 'educational outlier' ahead
OL,4,Cof other regions ` expert
OL,6,FThe gap between the proportion of A-
OL,7,Flevel entries in London getting the
OL,8,Ftop grades and the equivalent figure
OL,9,Fin both north-east England and the
OL,10,FEast Midlands has reached a new
OL,11,Frecord, according to Press Association
OL,12,Fanalysis.
OL,14,FSome 32.7% of entries in the capital
OL,15,Fwere awarded A or A* this year, up
OL,16,Ffrom 32.1% in 2025 and the highest for
OL,17,Fany region in England, the exam
OL,18,Fresults show.
OL,20,FThe North East and the East Midlands
OL,21,Fhad the joint lowest rate, at 23.1%.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1786726079
OL,3,CLondon now 'educational outlier' ahead
OL,4,Cof other regions ` expert
OL,6,FThe gap between London and each of
OL,7,Fthese two regions now stands at 9.6
OL,8,Fpercentage points, the largest since
OL,9,Fthe present system of grading began in
OL,10,F2010.
OL,12,FLee Elliot Major, social mobility
OL,13,Fprofessor at Exeter University said:
OL,14,F"England is no longer defined by a
OL,15,Fsimple north`south divide.
OL,17,F"It is increasingly a story of London
OL,18,Fpulling away from much of the country.
OL,26,@vD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1786726079
OL,3,CLondon now 'educational outlier' ahead
OL,4,Cof other regions ` expert
OL,6,F"Today's results show a record gap in
OL,7,Ftop A-level grades between London and
OL,8,Fthe lowest-performing regions.
OL,10,F"Our capital has become an educational
OL,11,Foutlier, while too many young people
OL,12,Fin the North East, East Midlands and
OL,13,Fother parts of the country are growing
OL,14,Fup in very different worlds of
OL,15,Fopportunity.
OL,17,F"Talent is spread evenly across the
OL,18,Fcountry; opportunity is not.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1786726079
OL,3,CLondon now 'educational outlier' ahead
OL,4,Cof other regions ` expert
OL,6,F"These record regional divides are
OL,7,Fanother warning that our education
OL,8,Fsystem is not working for a
OL,9,Fsignificant number of young people.
OL,11,F"The warning lights are flashing:
OL,12,Fpersistent attainment gaps by
OL,13,Fbackground and place, historically
OL,14,Fhigh levels of school absence, and
OL,15,Fgrowing divides outside the school
OL,16,Fgates.
OL,18,F"Too many rural, coastal and post-
OL,19,Findustrial communities have been left
OL,20,Fwith fewer educational and economic
OL,21,Fopportunities."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUzD@AOU}D@OO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1786726079
OL,3,CLondon now 'educational outlier' ahead
OL,4,Cof other regions ` expert
OL,6,FProf Elliot Major called for an
OL,7,F"ambitious, region-first approach" to
OL,8,Ftackle barriers faced by young people
OL,9,Finside and outside of school.
OL,11,FThe Press Association's analysis shows
OL,12,Fthat gap between London and north-east
OL,13,FEngland has widened from 9.2 points in
OL,14,F2025, though the proportion of entries
OL,15,Fin the North East getting A or A* rose
OL,16,Fslightly this year, from 22.9% to
OL,17,F23.1%.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@bO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1786726079
OL,3,CLondon now 'educational outlier' ahead
OL,4,Cof other regions ` expert
OL,6,FBy contrast, the East Midlands saw a
OL,7,Fdrop in entries awarded the top
OL,8,Fgrades, from 23.8% to 23.1%, the
OL,9,Fbiggest fall of any region.
OL,11,FThis pushed the gap with London up
OL,12,Ffrom 8.3 points in 2025 to 9.6 points
OL,13,Fthis year.
OL,15,FTwo other regions saw a year-on-year
OL,16,Ffall in entries awarded the top
OL,17,Fgrades: eastern England, down from
OL,18,F28.0% to 27.9%, and north-west
OL,19,FEngland, down from 26.6% to 26.5%.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1786726079
OL,3,CLondon now 'educational outlier' ahead
OL,4,Cof other regions ` expert
OL,6,FAfter London, the region with the
OL,7,Fhighest percentage of entries getting
OL,8,FA or A* was south-east England, at
OL,9,F31.5%.
OL,11,FSkills minister Baroness Jacqui Smith
OL,12,Ftold the Press Association the
OL,13,FGovernment is focused on closing
OL,14,Fattainment gaps.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G8/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1786726079
OL,3,CLondon now 'educational outlier' ahead
OL,4,Cof other regions ` expert
OL,6,FShe said: "It's got to be the case
OL,7,Fthat wherever you are in the country,
OL,8,Fyou stand a really, good chance of
OL,9,Fbeing able to achieve what you want to
OL,10,Fachieve, whether or not that's going
OL,11,Fto university or getting onto a good
OL,12,Fapprenticeship.
OL,14,F"And at the moment, there are gaps.
OL,16,F"Talent is everywhere, but opportunity
OL,17,Fisn't spread as fairly as it needs to
OL,18,Fbe.
OL,26,@nD@KOUvD@AOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G9/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1786726079
OL,3,CLondon now 'educational outlier' ahead
OL,4,Cof other regions ` expert
OL,6,F"That's why we've made a real thing in
OL,7,Fgovernment about how we close that
OL,8,Fdisadvantage gap."
OL,10,FHenri Murison, chief executive of the
OL,11,FNorthern Powerhouse Partnership, said:
OL,12,F"It is disappointing that every region
OL,13,Fof England for A-level at A* and A is
OL,14,Fbelow the English average apart from
OL,15,FLondon and the South East, and the gap
OL,16,Fbetween all three northern regions and
OL,17,FLondon has widened since last year.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@RO]tD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G10/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37411
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1786726079
OL,3,CLondon now 'educational outlier' ahead
OL,4,Cof other regions ` expert
OL,6,F"That means young people in the North
OL,7,Fare still behind when it comes to
OL,8,Fsecuring the highest grades that open
OL,9,Fthe door to the most competitive
OL,10,Funiversity courses.
OL,12,F"The North is home to many of the
OL,13,Fcountry's leading universities and we
OL,14,Fmust all do more to open the door to
OL,15,Fthose opportunities."
OL,17,FAt a national level, 10.7% of A-level
OL,18,Fentries this year in Wales received
OL,19,FA*, higher than the equivalent figure
OL,20,Ffor England (9.6%) and Northern
OL,21,FIreland (8.8%).
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUwD@UO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G11/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37412
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1786726079
OL,3,CLondon now 'educational outlier' ahead
OL,4,Cof other regions ` expert
OL,6,FFor entries awarded A or above,
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland was ahead at 30.7%,
OL,8,Fabove Wales (29.6%) and England
OL,9,F(28.3%).
OL,11,FPaul Whiteman, general secretary of
OL,12,Fschool leaders' union NAHT, said:
OL,13,F"Regional disparities in A-level
OL,14,Fgrades remain a concern.
OL,26,@uD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G12/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37413
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1786726079
OL,3,CLondon now 'educational outlier' ahead
OL,4,Cof other regions ` expert
OL,6,F"While it is hard to pinpoint the
OL,7,Freasons for this, levels of poverty,
OL,8,Fvarying investment into education,
OL,9,Fhealth, social care and other support
OL,10,Fservices and infrastructure, and the
OL,11,Flingering impact of the pandemic, may
OL,12,Fall have a part to play.
OL,14,F"This isn't an issue that arises
OL,15,Fovernight when students start sixth
OL,16,Fform or college, but can be baked in
OL,17,Ffrom a young age.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G13/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37414
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1786726079
OL,3,CLondon now 'educational outlier' ahead
OL,4,Cof other regions ` expert
OL,6,F"That is why it's vital the Government
OL,7,Fmaintains a strong focus on, and
OL,8,Finvestment in, the early years, as
OL,9,Fwell as in addressing the root causes
OL,10,Fand impact of poverty."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@WO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G14/14
